<main class="container py-5">
  <!-- About Us Section -->
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-4 display-3 animated fadeInUp">About KSR Recipes</h1>
      <p class="lead mb-4 animated fadeInUp delay-1s">
        At KSR Recipes, we believe in bringing you the best culinary experiences
        with a wide range of delicious recipes that are easy to follow and made
        with love.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mission Section -->
  <div class="row justify-content-center align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="mb-4 animated fadeInUp">Our Mission</h3>
      <p class="animated fadeInUp delay-2s">
        Our mission is to share the joy of cooking with everyone. We strive to
        provide you with a wide variety of recipes that cater to different
        tastes, dietary needs, and skill levels. Whether you're a novice cook or
        a seasoned pro, we have something for everyone!
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <img
        src="/img/american-food.jpg"
        alt="Mission Image"
        class="img-fluid rounded animated fadeInUp delay-3s"
        width="500"
        height="300"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Our History Section -->
  <div class="row justify-content-center align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2">
      <h3 class="mb-4 animated fadeInUp">Our Story</h3>
      <p class="animated fadeInUp delay-2s">
        Founded in 2021, KSR Recipes started as a humble food blog, and over the
        years, we have evolved into a leading source of creative and tasty
        recipes. Our team is made up of passionate food lovers who believe in
        making cooking accessible to everyone. What started as a small project
        is now a community of food enthusiasts sharing recipes, tips, and tricks
        from around the world.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
      <img
        src="/img/indian-food.jpg"
        alt="History Image"
        class="img-fluid rounded animated fadeInUp delay-3s"
        width="500"
        height="300"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Our Values Section -->
  <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <h3 class="text-center mb-4 animated fadeInUp">Our Values</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 animated fadeInUp delay-1s">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <i class="bi bi-heart fs-1 mb-3"></i>
              <h5 class="card-title">Passion for Cooking</h5>
              <p class="card-text">
                We believe in the power of food to bring people together, and we
                are passionate about creating recipes that are both tasty and
                easy to follow.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 animated fadeInUp delay-2s">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <i class="bi bi-people fs-1 mb-3"></i>
              <h5 class="card-title">Inclusivity</h5>
              <p class="card-text">
                We value diversity in food and culture, offering recipes that
                cater to various dietary needs and preferences.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 animated fadeInUp delay-3s">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle fs-1 mb-3"></i>
              <h5 class="card-title">Quality Ingredients</h5>
              <p class="card-text">
                We believe in using fresh, high-quality ingredients to elevate
                the flavors of every dish we create.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 animated fadeInUp delay-4s">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <i class="bi bi-chat-dots fs-1 mb-3"></i>
              <h5 class="card-title">Community</h5>
              <p class="card-text">
                We foster a supportive community of food lovers who can share
                their ideas and experiences with one another.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <div class="text-center mt-5">
    <h4 class="animated fadeInUp delay-2s">Join Our Community</h4>
    <p class="animated fadeInUp delay-3s">
      We would love for you to join us on our culinary journey. Follow us on
      social media, share your favorite recipes, and be part of our growing
      community.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary animated fadeInUp delay-4s"
      >Contact Us</a
    >
  </div>
</main>
